Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:02:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 120/149] xmp: custom music repeat, title playback control and
 stopped state (WWE2K14_XMP_FIX=1)

WWE 2K14 #10: Jukebox custom songs repeat per the XMP playback behaviour, pause while the title holds
playback control, report stopped state; bounded XMP message log; zero-frame guard. Host test:
custom_music_player_test.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
